Network use is distribution
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

AGPL section 13 requires that users who interact with this service remotely over
a network be offered its Corresponding Source. The process for that is
documented in docs/legal/AGPL_SOURCE_OFFER.md.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Incorporated works
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

This service incorporates Swiss Ephemeris (Astrodienst) and the sweph Node.js
binding under AGPL-compatible terms. See the repository NOTICE file and
docs/legal/SWISS_EPHEMERIS_LICENSE_DECISION.md.

Swiss Ephemeris data files are downloaded rather than vendored; they are pinned
by commit and SHA-256 in apps/calc-stub/ephemeris.lock.json.

